  "attribution": {
    "original_author": "Levent Alpöge",
    "proof_edits": "Fortytwo Engine: Deepseek Flash V4.1 1017",
    "new_contribution": "Fortytwo native Lean proof simplification in GroundTheory.HeightsAndTheta.Heights.SemipositiveHeights.NumericalSegre, from phase3-fast-core34-r01, adapted to the published Core 34 target. Original proof by Levent Alpöge. Codex reused graded polynomial and Hilbert function lemmas across the retained proof modules. A universe-polymorphic Hilbert function vanishing theorem supplies both applications. A single induction on the killed grading blocks proves both Krull dimension bounds. The projective pushforward proof uses the existing existence theorem for a homogeneous form outside a relevant prime."
  },
